      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FOOL.\n[Singing.]\n   He that has and a little tiny wit,\n     With heigh-ho, the wind and the rain,\n   Must make content with his fortunes fit,\n     Though the rain it raineth every day.",
